	sub [R Racute Rcaron Rcommaaccent Rdotbelow Rdotbelowmacron Rmacronbelow Rinvertedbreve Rdblgrave]' [R Racute Rcaron Rcommaaccent Rdotbelow Rdotbelowmacron Rmacronbelow Rinvertedbreve Rdblgrave AE AEacute AEmacron] by [R.short Racute.short Rcaron.short Rcommaaccent.short Rdotbelow.short Rdotbelowmacron.short Rmacronbelow.short Rinvertedbreve.short Rdblgrave.short];
} RShort;

